            "Store obstacle coordinates contiguously, sort and deduplicate them, and build row offsets for row-oriented scans.",
            "For at most N unique obstacles, use factorial-based binomial counts and first-hit inclusion-exclusion over obstacle pairs.",
            "For sufficiently large OpenMP grids, compute 64×64 tiles in anti-diagonal waves with static scheduling and rolling boundary buffers.",
            "Use a one-row rolling DP with obstacle-delimited scans for smaller grids or builds without OpenMP.",
            "Disable synchronized iostreams for obstacle input."
          ]
        },
